  "mechanistic_interpretation": {
    "established": [
      "Direct positive Champion-relative Teacher utility substantially improves correction strength relative to binary selective in several synthetic regimes: capture/gain wins were 4/5 and 4/5 in CLEAN, 5/5 and 5/5 in NOISY, 5/5 and 3/5 in WEAK, and 5/5 and 4/5 in NEAR_OPTIMAL.",
